Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates a pixel-perfect Space Invaders game, based on the original 1978 Taito arcade cabinet.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders · 1978 Taito</title>
  <style>
    /* Minimal reset, pixel aesthetic */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    }
    body {
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet-wrapper {
      background: #111;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px 30px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.2);
      border: 2px solid #333;
    }
    .game-container {
      position: relative;
      background: #000005;
      border: 4px solid #222;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px;
      display: inline-block;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #000005;
      width: 800px;
      height: 800px;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
    }
    .info-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: #0f0;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      text-shadow: 0 0 5px #0f0;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
